# Keep the API image small and reproducible. The build context is the platform root, so this
# excludes everything the image does not need — including any dist/ built on the host, which
# is rebuilt inside the image instead.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/test-artifacts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
frontend
mobile
chargeback-pro
*.md

# Never let a credential file reach a build context. Compose injects secrets at run time.
**/.env
**/.env.*
